    "description": "Traffic Light Controller FSM with explicit synthesizable timer-based state transitions. Assumptions: 1) Off-by-one semantics: A state active for N cycles is occupied for exactly N clock edges including entry (cycles 0 to N-1). 2) Counter reset/clear: timer_cnt clears to 0 on state entry and asynchronously on active-low reset_n = 0. 3) Reset style: Asynchronous active-low reset forces state to RED with timer_cnt cleared. 4) Output registering: Outputs (red_light, green_light, yellow_light) are decoded from state with strict one-hot mutual exclusivity in all states.",
    "author": "Hardware GraphRAG",
